App-plan WP09 no-claim proof mirrors shared app/game WP09 security proof.

Covered:
- running is not foreground;
- foreground is not content;
- title refs are permission-gated;
- permission-limited foreground metadata remains explicit;
- unknown foreground process is not auto-promoted;
- launcher focus is not active game proof;
- foreground duration cannot exceed running duration.

Not claimed:
- live foreground polling;
- policy execution;
- broad blocking;
- raw app content capture.
